  <div data-id="f1-explore" data-name="What I explored" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '7', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: '100%', alignItems: 'center', padding: '24px 20px 0px 20px' }}>
      <div data-id="f1-explore-in" data-name="Column" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '0', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: '100%', maxWidth: '600px', gap: '16px' }}>
        <p data-id="f1x-p1" data-name="Body" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '0', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '18px', lineHeight: '1.6' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: '600', color: '#16191C' }}>What I explored.</span> In September 2026 there were several ways to let an AI agent show something on a screen. I compared them on one question: who draws the interface, the agent or the app?</p>
        <div data-id="f1x-table" data-name="Approaches table" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '1', display: 'grid', gridTemplateColumns: 'minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr)', width: '100%', marginTop: '6px', marginBottom: '6px' }}>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-h-1" data-name="Header" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '0', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#666C73', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '1.4', fontWeight: '600', letterSpacing: '0.04em', textTransform: 'uppercase', padding: '10px 12px 10px 12px', borderBottom: '2px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Approach</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-h-2" data-name="Header" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '1', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#666C73', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '1.4', fontWeight: '600', letterSpacing: '0.04em', textTransform: 'uppercase', padding: '10px 12px 10px 12px', borderBottom: '2px solid #E6E7EB' }}>The agent sends</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-h-3" data-name="Header" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '2', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#666C73', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '1.4', fontWeight: '600', letterSpacing: '0.04em', textTransform: 'uppercase', padding: '10px 12px 10px 12px', borderBottom: '2px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Why not</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-1-1" data-name="Row label" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '3', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#16191C', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', fontWeight: '600' }}>AG-UI</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-1-2" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '4', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>A live stream of interface events</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-1-3" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '5', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Needs a live session. An agent posting at 6 AM has nobody watching.</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-2-1" data-name="Row label" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '6', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#16191C', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', fontWeight: '600' }}>A2UI</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-2-2" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '7', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>A layout tree</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-2-3" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '8', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Stores layout, not facts. A feed can't sort or filter a layout.</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-3-1" data-name="Row label" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '9', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#16191C', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', fontWeight: '600' }}>MCP Apps</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-3-2" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '10', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Mini-apps inside a chat</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-3-3" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '11', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Lives inside the chat app, not in a feed.</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-4-1" data-name="Row label" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '12', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#16191C', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', fontWeight: '600' }}>OpenClaw Canvas</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-4-2" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '13', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>A widget the agent writes</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-4-3" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '14', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB' }}>Agent-written HTML: unsafe, and every card would look different.</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-5-1" data-name="Row label" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '15', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#16191C', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', fontWeight: '600', backgroundColor: '#EEF1FD' }}>Typed cards</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-5-2" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '16', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', backgroundColor: '#EEF1FD' }}>Facts, in a fixed shape per kind</p>
          <p data-id="f1x-table-5-3" data-name="Cell" style={{ position: 'relative', order: '17', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '1.45', padding: '12px 12px 12px 12px', borderBottom: '1px solid #E6E7EB', backgroundColor: '#EEF1FD' }}>The app draws them, sorts them and can restyle them all at once.</p>
        </div>
        <p data-id="f1x-p2" data-name="Body" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '2', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '18px', lineHeight: '1.6' }}>Each kind has a short contract: what's required, what's optional and what must never be guessed. An event needs its timing and either a venue or "virtual." A movie card carries IMDb and Rotten Tomatoes scores, and MyAnimeList for anime. The server checks every card against the same contract the agent reads.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
